  "quantity": "Actual one all-rank Family 200 with physical Euler foldr, all original Gamma 9--21 labelled occurrences (each rank at least four) and all sorted tail ranks. The previous Fine signed residual at cap 2N and target N is its exact native rank sum. Output includes actual integer HB smooth pullback and per-group normalized rough von Mangoldt atlas.",
  "open": [
    "The supported same-Fine-rho genuine prime distribution saving on the whole native all-rank family",
    "If using the Lambda HB expansion, proper prime powers, collisions and nonclassical distribution remain separate from its exact rough Lambda identity.",
    "Other original seed, feedback, 430+11 and root responsibilities remain."
  ],
